    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32339" root="غلى" body-key="g">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغلّى</span></b>  (S, Msb, K) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالغَالِيَةِ</span> (S, Msb) <i>He</i> (a
man, S, Msb) <i>perfumed himself,</i> (S, * Msb, K,)
or <i>rubbed himself over,</i> (K,) with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَالِيَة</span>; (S, Msb,
K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغتلى</span></b>  signifies the same; (IDrd, O

in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غلف</span>;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَغَلَّلَ</span>, (Msb, and O in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غلف</span>,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِغْتَلَّ</span>. (O in that art.)

